Citationberg unchanged CSL test-fixture attribution

Scope: the eight files listed below from upstream citationberg commit
06a591e2f237d25e1dfdedac3f3d1494c496c52d. These files remain unchanged.
Their license is CC-BY-SA-3.0, as stated in every fixture and upstream NOTICE.
They are filesystem-read test data; the production renderer does not embed them.
The citationberg library code retains MIT OR Apache-2.0 licensing.
This project-authored attribution metadata does not relicense the fixtures.

